 "reader_notes": [
  "bid/ann_yield are yfinance screening quotes, ~15 min delayed. Confirm on IBKR before any ticket.",
  "vol_rank_proxy is an HV30 percentile, NOT the 52-week IV Rank the doctrine specifies. No IV history is available from either feed.",
  "PROVISIONAL_PASS = every doctrine test in this file passed; the items in confirm_on_ibkr still have to be checked live.",
  "Full inputs remain in brief_market.json / scan.json if a number here needs auditing.",
  "v10.0: exp_date/dte at the top are the run DEFAULT. A ticker whose earnings fall inside it is moved to an earlier listed Friday (flag EXPIRY_MOVED_BEFORE_EARNINGS) - read exp/dte per row.",
  "v10.0: EXDIV_INSIDE_TENOR, EARNINGS_INSIDE_TENOR and INFO_LOW_OI / INFO_LOW_VOLUME / INFO_WIDE_SPREAD are flags, not rejects. Liquidity is checked by the owner on IBKR before the ticket.",
  "15 Nov 2026: EARNINGS_DATE_UNKNOWN / EARNINGS_ESTIMATED_* mean the feed has no usable next earnings date (see data_quality) - get the real date before a ticket. INFO_EARNINGS_DATE_STALE = stale, but the estimate is clear of the tenor. QUOTE_SUSPECT = the feed bid is far above the model price; the yield is not real until IBKR confirms it.",
  "v10.1 (15 Nov 2026): above_size_cap = strike x 100 is over the per-ticker cap at nlv_assumed (20%; gold 40%; IBIT none). Recompute at the real NLV. INFO_VOL_RANK_PROXY in Zones B/C is information, not a reject (it still rejects in Zone A). ATR is the true-range ATR(14). alt_expiries lists other listed expiries (30-55 DTE) for when the default expiry week is taken.",
  "15 Nov 2026: G0-8 is now the WEEKLY RSI the spec asks for (it was daily until 13 Nov) - gate0.spy_rsi_basis says which was used. Scores before this date are not like-for-like on that indicator.",
  "quote_session != RTH: option quotes were taken after the close and are degraded. CREDIT_BELOW_MIN / WIDE_SPREAD / NO_LIVE_BID / yields are not reliable; zone, gate, blackout, ex-div and concentration verdicts are."
 ]
